{"4149640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "On the Rocks", "steam_appid": 4149640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4770030], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Water almost ran out. What's left is toxic. You run the only bar that still serves something worth drinking.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/2ae0fff6d17b82d401b25090178be5a9.poster.avif?t=1784640885\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/2ae0fff6d17b82d401b25090178be5a9.webm?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/2ae0fff6d17b82d401b25090178be5a9.mp4?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hands-on brewing system lets you purify toxic liquids into safe water, or ferment them into rare drinks worth real trade value. Your machines are visible, mechanical, and satisfying to run. Upgrade them. Push them harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/8157ed7a39fd2f87fa09c75cb17af52c.poster.avif?t=1784640885\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/8157ed7a39fd2f87fa09c75cb17af52c.webm?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/8157ed7a39fd2f87fa09c75cb17af52c.mp4?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers come with caps, grudges, and requests. Manage your stock, your prices, and your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/3c2299a479095c65772da7538eb9ea50.poster.avif?t=1784640885\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/3c2299a479095c65772da7538eb9ea50.webm?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/3c2299a479095c65772da7538eb9ea50.mp4?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your  establishment from a dusty shack into a sprawling post-apocalyptic tavern. Customize the layout for your customers, but don't forget to build heavy barricades to hold off nighttime raiders or mutants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/c2334ba18b6ae3b5f5cc1861c2f86b8b.poster.avif?t=1784640885\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/c2334ba18b6ae3b5f5cc1861c2f86b8b.webm?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/c2334ba18b6ae3b5f5cc1861c2f86b8b.mp4?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venturing into the wasteland isn't just about scavenging resources. Find rare, toxic chemical deposits and turn them into the most addicting, high-margin beverages the survivors have ever tasted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/9672b3bda483bf901f7df88e579ec56e.poster.avif?t=1784640885\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/9672b3bda483bf901f7df88e579ec56e.webm?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/9672b3bda483bf901f7df88e579ec56e.mp4?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a living wasteland metropolis surviving amidst the ruins. Interact with desperate local inhabitants, trade rare loot with sketchy merchants, and risk your hard-earned profits at the casino while exploring the dead city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/856ca28d0cdee6c6d895a5340cac86a7.poster.avif?t=1784640885\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/856ca28d0cdee6c6d895a5340cac86a7.webm?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/856ca28d0cdee6c6d895a5340cac86a7.mp4?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure brutal radioactive storms, sudden supply shortages, and chaotic customer fights. Adapt your management strategy to the harsh realities of the wasteland to keep your outpost alive. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The wasteland is dark. The bar is lit. Keep both alive.How long can you stay open?</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Water almost ran out. What's left is toxic. You run the only bar that still serves something worth drinking.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/2ae0fff6d17b82d401b25090178be5a9.poster.avif?t=1784640885\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/2ae0fff6d17b82d401b25090178be5a9.webm?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/2ae0fff6d17b82d401b25090178be5a9.mp4?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hands-on brewing system lets you purify toxic liquids into safe water, or ferment them into rare drinks worth real trade value. Your machines are visible, mechanical, and satisfying to run. Upgrade them. Push them harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/8157ed7a39fd2f87fa09c75cb17af52c.poster.avif?t=1784640885\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/8157ed7a39fd2f87fa09c75cb17af52c.webm?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149640/extras/8157ed7a39fd2f87fa09c75cb17af52c.mp4?t=1784640885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers come with caps, grudges, and requests. Manage your stock, your prices, and your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/